  "description": "Discover New Adventures with Extended Mileage. With our enhanced 15AH, 48V SAMSUNG battery, you can easily travel more than 30 miles.\nInterchangeable Between Class 2 and Class 3. Even though this bike is sent out of the factory as a class 2 e-bike with a top speed of 20mph, it can be adjusted to a class 3 topping out at 28mph as well. You can feel and see the difference with our torque sensor! Just contact us and we can have you setup as a class 3 in no time!\nRide in Unbeatable Comfort. Remember that feeling of the perfect armchair? Soft, cushiony, just right? That's what we aimed for with our latest seat design. This isn’t just a bike; it’s your outdoor lounge chair! We've also added a suspension seat post and suspension fork for improved comfort on more challenging terrain.\nOne Size Doesn’t Fit All, But We Got You. With enhanced sizing adjustments, our frame is great for anyone 5ft. and taller.\nSafety and Style, Hand in Hand. Safety might be our top priority, but we never compromise on style. We have advanced HYDRAULIC disc brakes that sync with a bright backlight. Plus, our LED front light ensures you're always visible.",
